&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ctorjschen&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4530800&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606935933&quot; alt=&quot;CTorJSChen&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4530800)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ctorjschen&quot;  &gt;CTorJSChen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;脚注&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-526657-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. 伍文定，时任吉安知府&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-526657-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. 1519年，宁王在叛乱前夕杀死都察院右副御史，江西巡抚孙燧。一同慷慨赴死的还有按察副使许逵。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-526657-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. 时任锦衣卫指挥使。&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
